EN:
Nice to meet you! Are you here
visiting?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Well, welcome to {{TAG:0005:0005:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
I hope you have a great time here,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

DE:
Oh, hallo! Bist du zu Besuch
in {{TAG:0005:0005:}}?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Herzlich willkommen!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Hoffentlich gefällt es dir hier,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
Tanıştığımıza memnun oldum! Ziyarete mi geldin?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
O zaman {{TAG:0005:0005:}}'a hoş geldin!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Umarım burada çok güzel vakit geçirirsin,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0019:}}Tiens... Je rêve déjà, on dirait...{{TAG:0007:0000:3C000000}}
Hé... Comment tu as fait pour venir
dans mon rêve, toi,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}} ?

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0019:}}Esneee.{{TAG:0007:0000:3C000000}} Daha şimdiden rüya mı görüyorum?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Sen buraya nasıl geldin,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}?

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0005:}} es el pueblo más molón.
¡Es como un sueño hecho realidad!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Explóralo bien,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Alors ? Laquelle est la ville la plus
belle ?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} La tienne ou la mienne ?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Moi,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} je dis la mienne,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}} !

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Sence hangi kasaba daha havalı,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} burası mı
